<WRAP important 100%>**Warning** The 5 GHz radio / Qualcomm Atheros QCA9886 does not work with latest 24.10.0 release.

With latest OpenWRT 24.10.0 release the 5 GHz radio / Qualcomm Atheros QCA9886 does not even work at all anymore. It does not even show up in wireless overview. If you need 5 GHz radio do not update but stay with OpenWRT 23.05.5 till the issue is fixed.
</WRAP>

