==== Potential USB 2.0 support ====

The main IC QCA9563 (under the metal shield) supports "Two USB 2.0 Host controllers with built-in MAC/PHY", however on the PCB, the pins are not connected to anything (except for VDD12_PLL_USB).

The following pins might be used for USB:

  * (Pin B43) VDD12_PLL_USB (connected to VCC?)
  * (Pin A55) USB_DP1 (**not connected**)
  * (Pin B42) USB_DM1 (**not connected**)
  * (Pin A53) VDD12_PLL_USB (connected to VCC?)
  * (Pin B40) USB_DP0 (**not connected**)
  * (Pin A52) USB_DM0 (**not connected**)

However is is extremely hard to connect the pins since the pin distance is only 0.5mm/0.026inches.

